<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Flywire Fusion Recap</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">Relive the magic of </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="http://www.flywire.com/fusion?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q4clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire Fusion</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #223341;"> 2024! Our inaugural U.S. education client conference and awards ceremony brought together more than 125 passionate higher education professionals to network, collaborate and get inspired by their peers. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">From insightful discussions to an innovative hackathon, it was an unforgettable experience. Big congrats to </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/flywire-fusion-star-awards-winners?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q4clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>our first Fusion Star award winners</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #223341;"> and a special thanks to our partner sponsors. Visit our microsite to view recap videos, session recordings, presentations and more. Stay tuned for details on Flywire Fusion 2025!</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
