</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join us for <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-q4-product-insights-open-forum?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q4clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire’s Q4 Product Insights Open Forum</u></strong></span></a> to get an update on our education solutions, including Student Financial Software (Billing &amp; Payment Management and Collection Management), Third-Party Invoicing, Payments &amp; the Flywire Dashboard, and eStore. Our product experts will share best practices and insights, answer your questions, and provide a sneak peek into our future roadmap.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
