<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Product Spotlight:</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Student Financial Software</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">We are excited to share that Flywire’s Student Financial Software offerings are being used by more than <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/news/flywire-showcases-strength-in-u-s-higher-education-business-at-its-inaugural-client-conference?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q4clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>100 institutions</u></strong></span></a> to deliver results. Our solutions revolutionize the way institutions manage the billing and payment process for current and past-due students.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Billing, payments, payment plans, and collection management are provided within a single platform, making it easier for institutions to manage the entire student financial journey while improving the student experience and accelerating revenue.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
